WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Your AI makes a decision. Your customer asks why.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:17.500
EPI records the decision and seals it into one file.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:29.500
They check it in their own browser. Nothing is uploaded.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:41.500
A re-sealed copy still verifies. Their witness log catches it.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:51.500
One workflow. Thirty days. Four thousand five hundred euros.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:59.000
Decision records your customer can check.
